==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The enemies spawn in finite numbers, so unless the player is able to brute force the Fallen Bear quickly, stalling out the enemies is vital. As always, any [[Li'l Gross Cat (Special Cat)|shield]] [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|piercers]] that can land hits on Fallen Bear work wonders, lowering the Bear's effective health by huge margins and making the stage much easier. Using many meatshields will help greatly to lessen the dual gories' pushing power.

